# A240896

Consider a number of k digits n = d_(k)*10^(k-1) + d_(k-1)*10^(k-2) + … + d_(2)*10 + d_(1). Sequence lists the numbers n such that sigma(n) - n = Sum_{i=1..k-1}{phi(Sum_{j=1..i}{d_(j)*10^(j-1)})} (see example below).

The 8 terms known to OEIS, indexed from `1`.

Skeleton generated by `lake exe oeis-gen`; every declaration is a `sorry` placeholder.
-/

